        "created_at": "2012-04-18T17:33:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, but every review of the game I’ve read has mentioned the lack of hp tracking and counters and such as the game’s only weakness (except, maybe the lack of scaling).  So even if only some small number of people actually use the new stuff, the SotM guys really do need to make it available.</p>",
